&lt;h2&gt;A dedicated Preferences window&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage PromeFTP settings in a separate macOS window, with four interface languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Preferences with ⌘,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use the General, Terminal, Authentication, Shortcuts, and About tabs without covering your workspace.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose an interface language&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;In General → Language, choose English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, or follow macOS. Save to apply the language while your sessions stay open.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage PAM and shortcuts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Review saved answers and global rules under Authentication. Find keyboard commands under Shortcuts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep your terminal preferences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Existing font and scrollback choices carry forward and apply to open terminals when you save.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active SSH, SFTP, and local shell sessions before installing. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.1"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
